hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"350","Mudabbar (woh ghulam jise aaqa ki maut par aazad karne ka wada kiya gaya ho): Hamein Umar ibn Hisham al-Qibti ne bayan kiya, hamein Ibn Dawud ne bayan kiya, Hasan ya'ni Ibn Salih se, Sufyan al-Thawri se, Khalid se, Abu Qilabah se, unhon ne kaha: Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne mudabbar ko teesre hisse mein rakha."
"351","Hamein Hannad ne bayan kiya, Ibn al-Mubarak se, Khalid se, Abu Qilabah se, ke Banu Udhrah ke ek shakhs ne apni beemari mein apna ghulam aazad kiya, us ke paas us ke siwa koi maal na tha; to Hazrat Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ne use do tihai mein mehnat karke ada karne ka hukm diya."
"352","Hamein Uthman ibn Abi Shaybah ne bayan kiya, hamein Hushaym ne bayan kiya, hamein Khalid ne khabar di, Abu Qilabah se, Banu Udhrah ke ek shakhs se, ke un mein se ek shakhs ne apni maut ke waqt apna ek ghulam aazad kiya; aur unhon ne is ka mafhoom bayan kiya."
